(1, 'Win a Brand New Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra (512GB)!', 'Celebrate with SK Laba Phone! Enter our official promotional giveaway for your chance to win a flagship Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra with free delivery direct from South Korea.', 'We are thrilled to give away a **Brand New Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra (512GB, Titanium Gray)** to one lucky winner!\n\n#### How to Participate:\n• Step 1: Follow SK Laba Phone on Facebook and TikTok\n• Step 2: Like, share, and tag two friends on our official giveaway post\n• Step 3: Check your email on the winner announcement date\n\n#### Official Terms & Prize Delivery:\n1. 100% authentic South Korean stock with full manufacturer warranty\n2. Free insured delivery or store pickup in Seoul\n3. The winner will be notified directly via email with official shop contact details', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610945265064-0e34e5519bbf', '2026-11-01 00:00:00', '2026-11-20 23:59:59', '2026-11-21 12:00:00', 'ONGOING', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-09 10:20:22', '2026-11-09 10:20:22');


